# Real assets are yours, not the repo's. The folders are created on demand by
# Tools/prepare-assets.py; do not put placeholder files in them — Xcode flattens
# bundle resources into the app root, so two same-named files in different
# asset folders collide at build time.
BrainrotAlarm/Assets/audio/*
BrainrotAlarm/Assets/images/*
